ipu-bridge: add Himax HM1092 (IR camera)

Describe the HM1092 IR sensor (ACPI HIMX1092) to the IPU: 1 lane,
648x368 RAW10 at 30 fps, 180.48 MHz link frequency. This is the IR camera
of the Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 (CSI-2 port 1, I2C on the Synaptics SVP7500
bridge's USB I2C). Without the entry ipu-bridge skips the sensor and the
IPU never links it.

--- a/ipu-bridge.c
+++ b/ipu-bridge.c
@@ -49,6 +49,8 @@
  * Please keep the list sorted by ACPI HID.
  */
 static const struct ipu_sensor_config ipu_supported_sensors[] = {
+	/* Himax HM1092 (IR), 1 lane RAW10 648x368@30: DDR clock 180.48 MHz */
+	IPU_SENSOR_CONFIG("HIMX1092", 1, 180480000),
 	/* Himax HM11B1 */
 	IPU_SENSOR_CONFIG("HIMX11B1", 1, 384000000),
 	/* Himax HM2170 */
